OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader apologises over
OL,4,ASEND delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader has apologised to
OL,7,Ffamilies for a backlog in assessing
OL,8,Fchildren with special educational needs
OL,9,Fand disabilities (SEND).
OL,11,FLucy Nethsingha, the Liberal Democrat
OL,12,Fleader of Cambridgeshire County
OL,13,FCouncil, said she recognised the county
OL,14,Fwas "particularly bad" at processing
OL,15,Fcases on time.
OL,17,FThere is a backlog of 1,800 children in
OL,18,FCambridgeshire waiting for Education,
OL,19,FHealth and Care Plans (EHCPs), a legal
OL,20,Fdocument outlining their needs and
OL,21,Fsupport.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
